ml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T16:54:00-08:00","id":1280206,"title":"","content":"I wish we could get an update to Hunter: The Reckoning, it was the only post-Changeling gameline in the oWoD that wasn't a total trainwreck (Mummy barely even qualifies as a gameline, and we all know how I feel about Demon and KOTE)<br /> <br /> Like, yeah Hunter had its flaws but it doesn't deserve near the amount of hate it gets. Especially compared to stuff like Demon and Wraith.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-11T21:18:47-08:00","id":1280252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1279732-h20-for-2019?p=1280152#post1280152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Technocracy Reloaded is debatably KS but Mage Victorian isn't, or the C20 pg.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, I was mostly asleep when I wrote that. I can fully imagine that they might drop some style guides for the Storyteller's Vault too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-12T16:01:00-08:00","id":1280412,"title":"","content":"I doubt that we will see any new 20th Anniversary lines - White Wolf (and their contractor, Modiphius) will want to focus on 5th edition books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://darker-days.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Darker Days Radio</a> - The World of Darkness Podcast<br /> <a href=\"http://historylessons.libsyn.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unbuttoned History</a> - A History Podcast with Jokes","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/124-darker-days-mike","name":"Darker Days Mike","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar124_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T10:48:55-08:00","id":1286781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darker Days Mike</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1279732-h20-for-2019?p=1280412#post1280412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt that we will see any new 20th Anniversary lines - White Wolf (and their contractor, Modiphius) will want to focus on 5th edition books.</div> </div> </div> </div>At this time, V5 has been a decent mess that several fans hated, so I don't know if pursuing 5th editions is going to be the best course for them, economically speaking. And we're talking about Vampire, the most popular game line amongst all the WW IPs.<br /> <br /> AFAIK Hunter: the Vigil has never been as popular as Reckoning, yet Vigil is getting a second edition this year - so why not a 20th for HtR? Personally I'd love to see a new HtR edition with more thematic Edges and better mechanics (like, can we finally get the distinction between aggravated and lethal damage?), I don't know why Paradox seems so uninterested in greenlighting it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13673-maris-streck","name":"Maris Streck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13673_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T13:48:45-08:00","id":1286832,"title":"","content":"Part of it may be that Reckoning was so strongly tied in with the &quot;Gehenna/Apocalypse/etc. is Next Week&quot; aspects of the World of Darkness metaplot at the time that it may not fit as well with what the x20 books have done. But that's just a guess.<br /> <br /> But, if there was a new edition, I just hope that this time it has artwork which actually reflects what the game is about. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T13:51:38-08:00","id":1286833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1279732-h20-for-2019?p=1286832#post1286832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of it may be that Reckoning was so strongly tied in with the &quot;Gehenna/Apocalypse/etc. is Next Week&quot; aspects of the World of Darkness metaplot at the time that it may not fit as well with what the x20 books have done. But that's just a guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah: the biggest challenge for a theoretical Hunter20 is rewriting the setting so that it's not dependent on Revised's metaplot elements.<br /> <br /> Same deal with a theoretical Mummy20 and Demon20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date"