d and his killer bothered to look through his belongings and find the papernote with this adress and has enough technicknowledge to understand and go to it.<br /> <br /> Anyway I would love to get with the 20th annisvary this year a H20 so that in two to four years it will be available in german.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-30T09:05:51-07:00","id":1392818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trippy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1279732-h20-for-2019?p=1291457#post1291457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eat less meat.</div> </div> </div> </div>And God said: &quot;I will give thee the power to banish children of serpent but you have to stop eating your animal brothers... I mean... you know... you shall inherit the Earth and... well that doesn't mean that you could eat my other creations...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint